# Documented exceptions to the image scan policy.
#
# The policy is: fail the build on fixable HIGH and CRITICAL findings. Anything
# listed here is a single, reviewed exception with a reason and an expiry date,
# not a lowered threshold. When an entry expires the build fails again and
# someone has to decide once more.

# openssl heap use-after-free in PKCS7_verify(). Alpine ships the fix in
# 3.5.7-r0, but node:20-alpine has not been rebuilt with it yet. Running
# `apk upgrade` at build time would pick it up, but it would also make two
# builds of the same commit produce different images, and we chose reproducible
# builds. Revisit when a patched node:20-alpine is published.
# Expires: 2026-09-30
CVE-2026-45447
